<title>UK: Caspian in children's catalogue sale talks.</title>
<headline>Caspian in children's catalogue sale talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Group Plc said on Monday it was in talks with Cinar Films Inc which might lead to the sale of the company's children's programme catalogue.</p>
<p>It made the statement in response to &quot;recent press speculation.&quot;</p>
<p>Cinar Films is a Montreal-based company which specialises in non-violent children's television programmes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
